---
import LegalLayout from "../components/LegalLayout.astro";
import { site, contact } from "../data/content.js";
---
<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy" updated="August 2026">
  <p>
    This page explains how {site.name} ("we", "us") handles information collected
    through this website. Replace this template text with a policy reviewed for
    your jurisdiction before going live.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>
    When you submit the contact form we receive the details you enter: your name,
    email address, project type, budget range, deadline and message. The site
    also uses basic hosting logs (IP address, browser type) kept by our host for
    security and analytics.
  </p>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <p>
    Contact submissions are used only to respond to your enquiry and discuss
    potential work. We do not sell or share your information with third parties
    for marketing.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party services</h2>
  <p>
    The contact form is delivered through a form provider, and scheduling is
    handled by an external booking tool. Fonts load from Google Fonts. Each of
    these receives the data needed to provide its service.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    To ask what data we hold about you, or to have it deleted, email
    <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy; the date above shows the latest revision.</p>
</LegalLayout>
